'''Frozen Steve''' is a {{Common}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water in the {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}.
== Spawning ==
'''Frozen Steve''' can be fished up from water in the {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}. It requires {{Skill|fishing|1}} to be fished up. 

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Frozen Steve''' is {{Green|5000}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|50%|1|2|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
